{"a":"71019d3c00","t":"plate","c":"[판독] 2026-10-11 / md: web/docs/engine/01_core.md §4.8·6.6\nbex RandModule async 엔진 vtable. 분포 함수 +0x10..+0x38\nRandMod(n): n < 2 → 0(소비 없음), 아니면 uniform_int(0, n−1)(기각 재추첨)\nRandRange(a,b): lo=min, hi=max(부호 없음). hi−lo < 2 → lo(소비 없음), 아니면 uniform_int(lo, hi−1) → [lo, hi)\nRandF: f32(u)·2^-32. RandModF(x): x ≤ 0 → 0, 아니면 fmadd(x, f32(u)·2^-32, 0)(한 번 반올림). RandRangeF(a,b): fmadd(f32(max−min), f32(u)·2^-32, min)"}
{"a":"71019d3c50","t":"plate","c":"[판독] 2026-10-11 / md: web/docs/engine/01_core.md §4.8·6.6\nbex RandModule sync 엔진 vtable. 분포 함수 +0x10..+0x38\nSyncRandMod(n): n < 2 → 0(소비 없음), 아니면 (u × n) >> 32\nSyncRandRange(a,b): 같은 조건, lo + ((u × (hi−lo)) >> 32)\nSyncRandF: f32(u)·2^-32 (u ≥ 0xFFFFFF80이면 1.0). SyncRandModF(x): x ≤ 0 → 0, 아니면 f32(f32(u) × x) × 2^-32. SyncRandRangeF: f32(min + f32(f32(d × f32(u)) × 2^-32)), d = f32(max − min)"}
